00:06:03.785 --> 00:06:06.995
So, that's, that's a good one I think. Input output.

00:06:06.995 --> 00:06:08.390
What's the issue with that one?

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:16.130
[NOISE] So, yeah.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:19.410
[inaudible]

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:23.165
